guide forever/horde/05-stonetalon
title Stonetalon Mountains
faction Horde
levels 24-25
zone Stonetalon Mountains
next forever/horde/06-ashenvale

# Built from the simulator's consensus Horde route
# and Era-baseline reference data; not yet play-tested on Forever.
#
# Flow: in from the Barrens past Malaka'Jin -> up the Webwinder Path:
# Besseleth, Ziz Fizziks -> Windshear Crag (Super Reaper blueprints, Piznik)
# -> Ziz Fizziks -> Sun Rock Retreat (flight path, bind) -> the burned-out
# note's trail west of Sun Rock -> Gaea Seeds at Mirkfallon Lake -> Sun Rock
# -> the Charred Vale (Gaea mounds, fire elementals, Bloodfury harpies) ->
# north to the Cenarion grove below Stonetalon Peak -> hearth to Sun Rock ->
# north again past the Peak into Ashenvale, to Zoram'gar Outpost
# (forever/horde/06-ashenvale).
#
# Deviations from the consensus: the consensus goes to Sun Rock first and
# comes back down to Ziz Fizziks and Windshear Crag, then kills Besseleth and
# hearths back up; here the Webwinder Path quests are done on the way up and
# the hearth is used after the Cenarion grove instead (without the addition
# below this guide takes 0.86 h under the simulator, Orc; the skeleton 0.90
# h). Added: Harpies Threaten (6282), in the Charred Vale with the fire
# elementals: +0.22 h here, -0.15 h at the end of
# forever/horde/07-thousand-needles (less grinding there).
#
# Further Instructions (1094) is accepted here and turned in to Sputtervalve
# when the route next lands in Ratchet (forever/horde/30-40/05-dustwallow).
#
# Optional: Arachnophobia (6284): Besseleth is elite, so grouping up is
# advised.
#
# Left out: Bloodfury Bloodline (6283, an elite harpy matriarch), Jin'Zil's
# Forest Magic (1058: 30 Courser Eyes at the Peak and the turn-in back in
# Malaka'Jin), the Seereth goblin chain (1061/1062/1068: The Spirits of
# Stonetalon alone measured +0.16 h, and the rest needs two returns to
# Seereth's camp on the Barrens border), Ordanus (1088, level 29, Alliance
# side of Ashenvale) and Earthen Arise (6481, needs 6421).

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Webwinder Path

step Besseleth
  tip The road from Malaka'Jin climbs north as the Webwinder Path. A Wanted poster stands beside it; Besseleth (level 21) hangs in her web in the side canyon to the west. Besseleth is elite: grouping up is advised.
  accept 6284 optional @59.1,75.7     -- Wanted Poster: Besseleth
  goto 52.0,73.9 "Besseleth's lair" optional
  collect 16192 quest 6284 optional

step Ziz Fizziks
  tip Further up the path, Ziz Fizziks has a hut where the road forks east to Windshear Crag.
  turnin 1483
  accept 1093

step Windshear Crag
  tip East of Ziz, the Venture Company is clear-cutting Windshear Crag. The Operators drive the shredders; one of them carries the blueprints. Piznik, a friendly goblin miner, works the small mine on the east side: stay with him while he mines, Venture Co. thugs come for him.
  goto 67.5,52.0 "Windshear Crag"
  collect 5734 quest 1093
  accept 1090                         -- Piznik
  complete 1090
  turnin 1090
  accept 1092

step Ziz Fizziks
  turnin 1092
  turnin 1093
  accept 1094                         -- Sputtervalve is in Ratchet: keep it for the boat from Booty Bay at about 39

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Sun Rock Retreat

step Sun Rock Retreat
  tip Follow the road west to Sun Rock Retreat.
  getfp "Sun Rock Retreat" npc 4312   -- Tharm
  sethome "Sun Rock Retreat" npc 7731 -- Innkeeper Jayka
  turnin 6284 optional                -- Maggran Earthbinder
  accept 6282
  accept 1087                         -- Braelyn Firehand, outside the gate
  accept 6393                         -- Tsunaman
  accept 6562                         -- Keep it: Je'neu Sancrea at Zoram'gar Outpost, Ashenvale
  accept 6301                         -- Tammra Windfield
  vendor nearest

step The note's trail
  tip West of Sun Rock the trail of the burned-out note goes on: Pocket Litter by the road, then a Mound of Dirt a little to the north.
  turnin 79192 @40.8,52.6             -- Pocket Litter
  accept 79980
  turnin 79980 @39.6,49.9             -- Mound of Dirt

step Gaea Seeds
  tip The Gaea Seeds lie in the grass around the southern shore of Mirkfallon Lake, north of Sun Rock.
  goto 48.8,40.7 "Mirkfallon Lake"
  collect 16205 quest 6301

step Sun Rock Retreat
  turnin 6301                         -- Tammra Windfield
  accept 6381

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Charred Vale

step The Charred Vale
  tip West of Sun Rock lies the burned Charred Vale. Plant the Gaea Seeds in the dirt mounds on the valley floor; the fire elementals that wander through it (Rogue Flame Spirits, Burning Ravagers and Destroyers) drop Incendrites. Bloodfury Harpies and Ambushers nest on the north side, Slayers and Roguefeathers to the south.
  goto 32.9,67.9 "Charred Vale"
  interact 177929 quest 6381          -- Gaea Dirt Mounds
  collect 16312 quest 6393
  kill 4022 quest 6282.1
  kill 4025 quest 6282.2
  kill 4024 quest 6282.3
  kill 4023 quest 6282.4

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Stonetalon Peak

step Cenarion grove
  tip Head north on the road past Mirkfallon Lake toward Stonetalon Peak. The Cenarion druids hold the grove below the peak.
  goto 36.5,13.0 "Cenarion grove"
  kill 4057 quest 1087.1
  kill 4053 quest 1087.2
  kill 4051 quest 1087.3

step Sun Rock Retreat
  hearth "Sun Rock Retreat"
  turnin 6381                         -- Tammra Windfield
  turnin 6393                         -- Tsunaman
  turnin 1087                         -- Braelyn Firehand
  turnin 6282                         -- Maggran Earthbinder
  note Braelyn's next quest, Ordanus, is level 29 on the Alliance side of Ashenvale. Skip it.

step North to Ashenvale
  zone Ashenvale
  tip Walk back north past Stonetalon Peak: the road crosses into Ashenvale. Keep west at the forks to reach the coast and Zoram'gar Outpost.
  getfp "Zoram'gar Outpost" npc 11901 -- Andruk
